::  Fixture for the documented examples; not supplied by the design doc.
::  One post, read by slug from a fresh scry on every request.
/-  blog
/=  api  /ui/api/blog
::
++  main  page load view
++  load  |=  slug=@ta  post.api slug same
::
++  view  |=  p=post.blog
  (column
    ~[pad+%s3 gap+%s2]
    ~[
      heading 1 title.p
      para ~[(text "This post's address is {slug.p}.")]
      el ~[tone+%accent] (link %/blog "All posts")
